---
import { docsUrl, saasLoginUrl } from "../lib/site";
---

<section class="bg-white">
  <div
    class="mx-auto grid max-w-screen-xl px-4 pb-8 pt-24 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-8 lg:py-16 lg:pt-28 xl:gap-0"
  >
    <div class="mr-auto place-self-center lg:col-span-7">
      <p class="mb-3 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-brand-600">
        API de facturación electrónica
      </p>
      <h1
        class="mb-4 max-w-2xl text-4xl font-extrabold leading-none tracking-tight text-gray-900 md:text-5xl xl:text-6xl"
      >
        Conecta tu sistema<br />con URL + API key
      </h1>
      <p
        class="mb-6 max-w-2xl font-light text-gray-500 md:text-lg lg:mb-8 lg:text-xl"
      >
        Emite facturas, boletas y GRE desde tu ERP, tienda o POS: URL de la API,
        Bearer token y secret de webhook. Acceso por solicitud (aún sin compra
        en línea). Panel opcional para operar y rotar keys.
      </p>
      <div
        class="flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row sm:flex-wrap sm:items-center"
      >
        <a
          href="#solicitud"
          class="inline-flex w-full items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-brand-500 px-5 py-3 text-center text-sm font-medium text-white hover:bg-brand-600 focus:ring-4 focus:ring-brand-300 sm:w-auto"
        >
          Solicitar acceso
        </a>
        <a
          href={docsUrl}
          class="inline-flex w-full items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-gray-200 px-5 py-3 text-center text-sm font-medium text-gray-900 hover:bg-gray-100 focus:ring-4 focus:ring-gray-100 sm:w-auto"
        >
          Documentación API
        </a>
        <a
          href="#empezar"
          class="inline-flex w-full items-center justify-center rounded-lg px-5 py-3 text-center text-sm font-medium text-gray-600 hover:bg-gray-50 focus:ring-4 focus:ring-gray-100 sm:w-auto"
        >
          Guía rápida
        </a>
        <a
          href={saasLoginUrl}
          class="inline-flex w-full items-center justify-center rounded-lg px-5 py-3 text-center text-sm font-medium text-gray-500 hover:bg-gray-50 sm:w-auto"
        >
          Ir al panel
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hidden lg:col-span-5 lg:mt-0 lg:flex">
      <img
        src="/images/hero.png"
        alt="Panel Factosys — ilustración de producto"
        class="w-full"
        width="640"
        height="480"
        loading="eager"
      />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
